==Strategy==
==='''Chapters 1 & 2'''===
Simply spam [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]], like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], to kill off the Doge Darks, and spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]] to finish off the Mooths and Maawths.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
The main threat this time around are 3 stacking 600% Maawths, but they stack very early and you have very little cash flow due to fewer peons. The silver lining is that there is no boss wave so once you beat the early onslaught the match is over.

It's different than the previous chapters because there are no Mooths at all, only 2 Doge Darks at the start to put about 1300¢ into your pocket each. Save up for Area Attack [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] and protect them with a steady flow of durable meatshields. However, because your cash flow is severely limited vs the 3 stacking 600% Maawths and very little peon flow, you will use no more than 3 meatshields.

